        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Cabin thermal\nCabin vs ambient soak and cooldown from `signal_log`. Precondition Wh integrates `HvacPower` while `PreconditioningEnabled` is on; without the flag the term stays unknown. τ fits live in the Science Lab."
      },
